 1473048977, "avatar": "11a109aa395bd5c2a89b14921020676fb0d2d95d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Update 2021 - Risk of Rain 2 added full controller support and integrated steam multiplayer, the dev listened to my feedback. But this game - Risk of Rain 1 - is still trash and not fixed, completely abandoned by the dev. So just buy the sequel instead :steamthumbsup:\n\nController doesnt work.\nOnline multiplayer doesnt work. \nGame is trash.\n\nFull explanation \n\nXbox one controller has extremely limited function. On the main menus it can control the cursor but at a snails pace. In game none of the inputs function whatsover. I even tried to see if remapping would fix it, but nope. I never encountered this issue with any of my other 150 steam games. \n\nI have no idea what hamatchi is, nor should a 3rd party program be necessary when modern steam games are steam-integrated with friends list functionality (invite, join game, etc). The dev is extremely lazy to not include steam-integrated multiplayer. A quick google search reveals similar issues on the PS4 version, which doesnt even have the option to run 3rd party port forwarding software.\n\nSo basically, this game is trash.", "timestamp_created": 1473049047, "timestamp_updated": 1615529801, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.305781275033950806", "comment_count": 6, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}